    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellowcake is an audio game. This means that the entire world and story are told in sound. To navigate in this game, you will need headphones or some other kind of audio device that allows you to localize sounds. Close your eyes and dive into a world like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellowcake is a first-person experience. You play as Vident, a young man with a special gift. He can hear objects, animals and humans - but not just in the ordinary way. Vident can hear people even if they stand perfectly still and hold their breath. And he can hear the rocky walls of the uranium mines, in which he lives and works - and whose secrets he will soon discover. This talent helps him navigate through  twisty caves and sneak past  guards who try to stop him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, this game will be suitable for sightless and visually impaired players.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellowcake is an audio game. This means that the entire world and story are told in sound. To navigate in this game, you will need headphones or some other kind of audio device that allows you to localize sounds. Close your eyes and dive into a world like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellowcake is a first-person experience. You play as Vident, a young man with a special gift. He can hear objects, animals and humans - but not just in the ordinary way. Vident can hear people even if they stand perfectly still and hold their breath. And he can hear the rocky walls of the uranium mines, in which he lives and works - and whose secrets he will soon discover. This talent helps him navigate through  twisty caves and sneak past  guards who try to stop him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, this game will be suitable for sightless and visually impaired players.</p>",
    "short_description": "A first-person audio game, telling the tale of a blind yet gifted hero. Make your way through a 3D environment without receiving any visual cues. Put all your faith in your ears and help our hero in his quest to uncover the sinister secrets of these twisty uranium mines, which he calls his home.",
